e maintaining eye contact.*\n\n*Purrrrrr...*\n\n*Sits on your keyboard. hhhfjdksla;;;;*\n\nThat captures cat essence. Keep it fairly short and punchy. Format: brief, evocative, maybe italics for actions."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":482,"total_tokens":606,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":349},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}